# Ledger 260 (Nov 16 21:18-21:22, building on a dug beach, seed 7780452129890778212: "it thinks there's sand on top of it,
# but there's not", "this block section is cursed", "That should fill in and remove the sand under it, but it doesn't").
# His dig's shaping ball kept every cell it reached as ground at +1/32 while the drawn surface went under the cell's
# middle: a cell drawn less than half full read as a whole block of sand (the aim, "Looking at", placing).
# Fixed: passes. BS_OLDSLIVERCELL=1: the dug cells stay "sand" (2 FAILED).
#   questcheck --scene quest/scenes/dug-cells.scene --headset --seed 7780452129890778212
at -2619.3 65.0 680.7
load 3
tick 1
fly on
give pale_moss_block 64
aimat -2620.5 64.6 679.5
hit
aimat -2621.5 64.6 679.5
hit
probe -2621 64 678
probe -2622 64 679
expect ground -2621 64 678 == false       # (the dig drew it under its middle: open, as it shows)
expect ground -2622 64 679 == false
aimat -2620.6 64.2 678.4
use
expect block -2621 64 678 == pale_moss_block   # (a block aimed into the dug cell fills it)
